source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
List, read, roll back and resume deploys.

Usage: ink deploy <COMMAND>

Commands
  list      History, newest first (also: ink deploys)
  show      One deploy: its build and its log
  rollback  Make an earlier deploy the live one, and pause new deploys
  resume    Let the site deploy new pushes again after a rollback

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink deploy --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
